Now there are two new faces on my screen.
It is my little sister, Sofía, and my big brother, Diego.
They laugh and push each other a little.
"Hello little sister and big brother!" I say happily.
"Hi Maya," says Diego.
My brother has a big smile.
"Is it cold in Denmark?" he asks.
"Is it a cold winter?"
"Yes, it is a very cold winter," I laugh.
"But I have a warm room and a cup of tea."
Now Sofía lifts a big thing up in front of the screen.
It is a large book.
"Do you have a new book there, Sofía?" I ask.
"Yes, it is my new book," my sister says proudly.
"It is a book from my university."
"It is a very thick book!"
I smile at my brother and my sister.
I miss my family in Mexico.
But they are right here on my little screen.
